From: RDK Build Compatibility
Subject: [PATCH] m4: remove redundant popen declaration

stdio.h already declares popen with its two arguments. This old empty-list
declaration becomes a zero-argument prototype with GCC 15 and conflicts with
the system declaration.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/src/builtin.c
+++ b/src/builtin.c
@@ -25,7 +25,5 @@
 #include "m4.h"
 
-extern FILE *popen ();
-
 #include "regex.h"
 
 #if HAVE_SYS_WAIT_H
